<< id:dataset dcso:ethicalIssueDescription "The only potential limitation to data-sharing could arise in the context of potential qualitative research which reveals demographic facts that might be used to identify participants. In the case of such research I will proceed as described above: de-identify the data (e.g., exclude references to a participant’s age or location) before uploading it to OSF, and, upon completion of the research, store the original data on a password-protected section of the above-mentioned flash-drive which can only be accessed by contributing researchers."@en >> dct:source id:DMP .
